# Heat off the Burning's ground, read at a glance from both cameras and lit, not
# drawn: ember motes rising round the feet, the air over the ground wavering, the
# ground and boots warmed from under (HeatFx, HazardCues `heat`). At noon, where
# it bites, and at 18:30, where it is only felt, each from above and over the
# shoulder, each frame half a second into a lift (`await shimmer` is its first
# moment; a lift is too short-lived for a shot to claim it).
#   tools/tour.sh tours/heat-shimmer.tour --seed=1 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
place burning
hour 13
await bites:heat 40
await shimmer 12
wait 0.5
shot 01-heat-from-above-noon with land:burning
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 5
await shimmer 12
wait 0.5
shot 02-heat-over-the-shoulder-noon with shoulder
release shoulder_peek
await top_view 5
hour 18.5
await heat 20
await shimmer 20
wait 0.5
shot 03-heat-from-above-dusk with land:burning
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 5
await shimmer 20
wait 0.5
shot 04-heat-over-the-shoulder-dusk with shoulder
release shoulder_peek
